  "id": "BIT-rclone-2026-116191",
  "summary": "Rclone before 1.75.2 Path Traversal via serve webdav MKCOL",
  "details": "Rclone before 1.75.2 contains a path traversal vulnerability in serve webdav that allows unauthenticated attackers to write above the served root by sending an unvalidated '..' path component. Attackers can send MKCOL /.. to plant a VFS node, then PUT, MOVE, COPY, or MKCOL to create, overwrite, or delete files belonging to other tenants.",
